 "template": "Metric Door.rft",
 "about": "Anti-barricade WC doorset modelled as a product: frame with architraves and a stainless reversible stop (jambs and head), key release cylinder over the head, top and bottom pivots with floor plate (no butt hinges), HPL leaf with lipping, lever, indicator lock with red window, thumbturn inside, kick plates, seals, WC sign. Geometry drawn at the first type's size; brand, model and supplier open for review. Reference: query: door toilet anti barricade doors hospital; images: https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=door+toilet+anti+barricade+doors+hospital; basis: generic product; brand, model and supplier open for review",
